      \"rationale\": \"Ukraine received estimated 150-200 sympathy points in 2022 (Kalush Orchestra). By 2026, this likely declines due to voter fatigue, but remains elevated if conflict continues. Comparable to Israel's baseline +30-50 sympathy points.\"
    },
    {
