    },
    {
      \"source\": \"Eurovision 2023 results - Tvorchi 'Heart of Steel'\",
      \"summary\": \"Ukraine placed 6th with 243 points, one year into war\",
      \"key_findings\": [
        \"Significant drop from 2022 despite ongoing war - suggests sympathy vote decay\",
        \"Still outperformed song quality metrics, indicating residual sympathy boost\",
