    },
    {
      \"source\": \"Historical Eurovision political voting patterns analysis\",
      \"summary\": \"Academic studies on bloc voting and political influence\",
      \"key_findings\": [
        \"Neighbor voting blocs (Balkans, Nordics, ex-USSR) consistently add 30-80 points\",
        \"Sympathy votes for conflict countries typically decay 40-60% year-over-year\",
